      "Any code, policy, ledger or spec change: the plan names guards (cargo xtask scope) and ledger rows (DP-5.1 to 5.3) that later packets build under approval",
      "Changing §3 to §7 (subject, layout, xtask design, corpus, record shapes) or the acceptance criteria of the W5 to W18 briefs, which stay as the reference",
      "Renumbering CHG ids: records and code cite them"
    ],
    "performance_impact": "none claimed",
